# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto
*.sol linguist-language=Solidity

# Generated system-contract artifacts. These hold compiled contract
# `deployedBytecode` as multi-KB single-line hex blobs, regenerated by
# core/systemcontracts/parliagenesis (`make build`/`make devnet`/...). They are
# generated output, not hand-edited source: mark them `linguist-generated` so
# GitHub collapses the diff and excludes them from language stats, and `-diff`
# so git/reviewers don't try to render the huge hex as a textual diff (which can
# break review tooling, e.g. Copilot code review).
script/local/genesis-contracts-dev.json linguist-generated -diff
core/systemcontracts/parliagenesis/*/*Contract linguist-generated -diff
